{
  "uid": "chatagent-overview",
  "title": "chatAgent · 服务总览",
  "description": "值班第一眼：现在有没有在出错。四条金信号（流量 / 错误 / 延迟 / 饱和度）+ 灰度流量分配。所有指标由 app/metrics.py 自产（GET /metrics），label 见 app/middleware.py。",
  "tags": [
    "chatagent",
    "overview"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "请求速率",
      "description": "全部路由合计 RPS。掉到 0 而又不是低峰期 ⇒ 先看 nginx 与 app-stable 是否在跑。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "RPS"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx 占比",
      "description": "服务端错误比例。分母用 clamp_min 兜底，避免低流量时被 0 除成 NaN（NaN 在图上看起来像「没问题」）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P95 延迟",
      "description": "SSE 接口的延迟天然偏高（一个回答几十秒），所以这条曲线要看「趋势」而不是绝对值。突然抬高通常是模型侧或检索侧退化。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "在途请求",
      "description": "当前正在处理的请求数（不受 metrics 开关影响）。滚动更新时看它是否排空：不为 0 就说明还有在途的 SSE。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(http_requests_in_flight)",
          "legendFormat": "in flight"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "各路由请求速率",
      "description": "path 是路由模板（不是原始 URL）—— 否则每个 id 都会变成一条线，把标签基数打爆。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (path) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
