    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "灰度流量分配（按 job）",
      "description": "stable 与 canary 各自的 RPS。发布/回滚时这是唯一能自证「权重真的改生效了」的图 —— 改 nginx 权重后若这里比例没变，说明 reload 没生效。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_requests_total{job=~\"chatagent-stable|chatagent-canary\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "延迟分位（P50 / P95 / P99）",
      "description": "三条一起看：只有 P99 抬高说明是长尾（个别慢请求）；三条同时抬高说明整体变慢。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "流式首 token 延迟（TTFT，P50 / P95 / P99）",
      "description": "用户等了多久才看见**第一个字**。只算主对话路径（kind=chat）的流式档：buffered 那一档是 agent 链路整段返回，它的「首字节」其实是整段生成耗时，与流式差一个数量级，混在一起会让分位数失去含义。红色虚线是 SLO 阈值 5 秒（stream_latency：95% 的请求首 token ≤ 5s）。⚠️ 超时的请求**没有样本**、不在这张图里 —— 它们计入可用性 SLI。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(llm_first_token_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\",mode=\"stream\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(llm_first_token_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\",mode=\"stream\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(llm_first_token_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\",mode=\"stream\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed",
              "line": true
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "流式 chunk 间延迟（TPOT，P50 / P95 / P99）",
      "description": "首 token 之后，相邻两个 chunk 之间隔了多久 —— 回答「第一个字很快，然后卡住」这种体验。口径同 OpenTelemetry 的 `gen_ai.client.inference.time_per_output_chunk`：每个首 chunk 之后的 chunk 记一次。\n⚠️ 跨模型调用的等待**不在**里面（那是工具执行，不是解码）；chunk 也**不等于** token（上游可能一次下发多个），所以别用它算 TPS。\n分诊：尖峰同时出现在 `event_loop_lag_seconds` ⇒ 我们自己堵住了事件循环；只有这条有尖峰 ⇒ 上游解码中途卡住。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(llm_inter_chunk_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(llm_inter_chunk_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(llm_inter_chunk_seconds_bucket{kind=\"chat\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "并发饱和率",
      "description": "在途 ÷ 上限。只有**比值**能回答「离被打满还有多远」，绝对值不能 —— 上限是多少只有配置知道。持续接近 100% 说明该加副本或调 MAX_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS；上限未配（0）时它恒为 0，那是「没有闸门」而不是「很空闲」（看启动日志确认）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(100 * http_concurrency_in_flight / clamp_min(http_concurrency_limit, 1))",
          "legendFormat": "saturation %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "并发闸门拒绝 / 在途数",
      "description": "背压真的生效时的样子：拒绝速率抬起来、在途数顶在上限上不下来。只有拒绝速率、在途数却很低 ⇒ 上限配得太小（正常流量被误拒）；只有 5xx 抬高、这里却全是 0 ⇒ 实例是被上游拖住的，不是并发满。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(http_requests_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "拒绝 {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "http_concurrency_in_flight",
          "legendFormat": "在途 {{instance}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "http_concurrency_limit",
          "legendFormat": "上限 {{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "索引身份（1=一致 0=不一致）",
      "description": "库里存着的向量，是不是用**当前**的 EMBEDDING_MODEL 灌的。最危险的情形是换了模型而维度没变（1024 → 1024）：旧向量还在库里、新查询用新模型编码，两者不在同一个向量空间，检索质量当场崩掉，而 QPS / 延迟 / 错误率**全部正常**。面板**没有数据**不等于「没问题」—— 那说明启动自检没跑（对照告警 IndexIdentityNeverReported）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(rag_index_identity_ok)",
          "legendFormat": "identity ok"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "不一致",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "一致",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "引用校验状态分布",
      "description": "每轮回答的引用校验结论（`citation_check_total` 按 status 拆分）。`ok` / `no_citations` 是常态；`unsupported`（模型标了**本轮命中里不存在**的编号）是唯一会触发告警的一类，对应 CitationUnsupportedFrequent。`weak`（与引用文本重叠偏低）与 `degraded`（被引用的源文件已不在语料目录）**不会**告警 —— 前者是启发式、后者该由 kb-prune 清孤儿，都不该拿来拦用户答案，放这里只为巡检。⚠️ 面板**没有数据**只说明最近没有请求，不等于「引用都对」。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 44
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(citation_check_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "agent 路由与移交",
      "description": "请求走的是 agent 链路还是问答兜底（`agent_route_total` 按 route）、跨节点转交的次数（`agent_handoff_total` 按 src/dst。⚠️ 拆分后只有 **前台 → 文学** 这一种组合，且是**请求口径** —— 它答的是「多少请求被交给了专家」，不是运行数）、以及**想走却走不了**的次数（`agent_unavailable_total` 按 reason）。⚠️ `agent_*` 序列**不存在**只说明最近没有 agent 流量，不等于链路正常；`reason=module_unavailable`（没装 openai-agents）或 `runtime_not_ready`（没配模型）在涨才是故障 —— 此时请求静默退回问答链路，零报错、探针全绿、答得「像那么回事」。对应告警 AgentLinkDegraded。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(agent_route_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "路由 {{route}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (src, dst) (rate(agent_handoff_total[30m]))",
          "legendFormat": "移交 {{src}} → {{dst}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(agent_unavailable_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "降级 {{reason}}"
        }
